## November 9, 2026

### Documentation foundation

Added a responsive SvelteKit documentation shell, MDsveX content, shared language examples, code copying, a live table of contents and five appearance choices.

### Learning workspace

Added glossary practice, category checks, seven interactive lab units and browser-local progress. Video lessons remain explicitly unavailable until real material is supplied.

### Developer surfaces

Added a working example sandbox API, Scalar reference, Markdown exports and a documentation finder with an optional server-side model connection.

## What this release does not connect

This is an independent local study project. It does not authenticate to MIOSA, grant account credits or operate real cloud resources.
